This directory is a runtime artifact location.

`pack.json` is regenerated on every /api/p/run from the scenario builder
(src/multi-agent/pack-builder.ts) using each participant's intake answers.
The file is git-ignored because it contains free-text participant content.

If you want to run the scenario from the CLI (`npm run run -- toyota-camry-negotiation`)
without going through the web flow first, run `npm run setup` once to generate
a baseline pack.json from interactive intake.
